Subject: [PATCH 6/8] feat(pull_requests): create a review with inline comments
 in one call

pull_request_review_write create accepts a comments array (path, line,
side, start_line, start_side, body). With event set, the review, its
body and its inline comments are submitted by one addPullRequestReview
mutation instead of create pending, add each comment, submit.

